<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 7.65 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation falls to 7.65 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index fell to 7.65 percent in the week ending March 15 from 7.78 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES   Mar 15, 1997  Mar 8, 1997  Mar 17, 1996</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +7.65	  +7.78	   +5.09</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  322.2	  322.6	   299.3</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended March 17, 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
